LRC14 q<=25 UNIFORMITY REFUTATION -- exact certificate
valid_pair_deck_criterion: for covering S and 15<=q<=25, a witness exists iff q has no zero owner and B_q(S) misses a unit sign-pair
nonunit_reason: reducing a/q gives q0<=12, and covering supplies a q0-divisible speed
unit_reason: q/14 is strictly between 1 and 2, so only residues 0,+1,-1 are unsafe
elementary_dilated_block_reason: if gcd(c,q)>1 choose i=q/gcd(c,q)<=12; otherwise choose the signed least representative of (a*c)^(-1), also <=12
